  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1229700/description_2c8ea66d-0e5e-44a2-8382-e2b3616ce9e9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"802\" height=\"648\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://static.vecteezy.com/system/resources/thumbnails/053/064/910/small/celestial-border-with-magic-moon-and-mystic-stars-astrology-ornament-with-spiritual-symbols-of-sun-esoteric-vintage-minimal-decoration-spiritual-frame-with-fantasy-elements-png.png\" alt=\"奇幻边框PNG免费下载\" width=\"290\" height=\"89\"></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/4WvV3EzxdP\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1347707912642101308?label=Discord&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=0843bf&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"237\" height=\"34\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>一款黑暗奇幻类魂RPG</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b9446af3-440c-4222-a904-19b561a9becb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"411\" height=\"65\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<strong>🛡️</strong> &nbsp;独特的战斗动画与机制，包含超过100种独立动作模组 <strong>（<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Epic Fight</span>）</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>自定义动作模组展示：</strong></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">觉醒巫妖之刃</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/awakened_lichblade.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"144\"> &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/demonic_lichblade.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"145\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">炉心烈焰</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/hearthflame_berserk.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"145\"> &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/hearthflame_combo.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"145\"> &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/hearthflame_skill.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"145\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">符文镰刃</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/runic_scythe_innate_skill.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"144\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/runic_scythe_traveler.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"144\"> &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/runic_scythe_combo.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"531\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">风语低吟</span></p>\n<p><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/whisperwind_basic_combo.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"141\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/whisperwind_deadly_combo.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\" height=\"141\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/whisperwind_innate_combo.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/whisperwind_sheath_innate.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\"> &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://apotheoticstudios.com/files/2026/05/whisperwind_true_combo.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"130\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<strong>🛡️</strong> &nbsp;重制的奇幻世界观、建筑、城镇等 <strong>（<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Integrated Structures</span>、<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Luki's Grand Capitals</span>、<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Explorify</span>）</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<strong>🛡️</strong>&nbsp; 战斗中触发的环境战斗音乐（<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Mob Battle Music</strong></span>）</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<strong>🛡️</strong> &nbsp;定制化纹理重制，贴合奇幻中世纪主题 <strong>（<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Excalibur</span>、<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Addons</span>）</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<strong>🛡️</strong> &nbsp;大量Boss战内容，强化ARPG元素 <strong>（<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Cataclysm</span>、<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Mowzie's</span>、<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Soulslike Weaponry</span>）</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<strong>🛡️</strong>&nbsp; 数百种武器及独特机制 <strong>（<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Simply Swords</span>、<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Epic Knights</span>、<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Dungeons and Combat</span>）</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<strong>🛡️</strong> &nbsp;完整的技能树与升级系统，多种职业可选 <strong>（<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Passive Skill Tree</span>、<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Just Leveling</span>）</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>推荐JVM参数：</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">-XX:+UnlockExperimentalVMOptions -XX:+UnlockDiagnosticVMOptions -XX:+AlwaysActAsServerClassMachine -XX:+AlwaysPreTouch -XX:+DisableExplicitGC -XX:+UseNUMA -XX:NmethodSweepActivity=1 -XX:ReservedCodeCacheSize=400M -XX:NonNMethodCodeHeapSize=12M -XX:ProfiledCodeHeapSize=194M -XX:NonProfiledCodeHeapSize=194M -XX:-DontCompileHugeMethods -XX:MaxNodeLimit=240000 -XX:NodeLimitFudgeFactor=8000 -XX:+UseVectorCmov -XX:+PerfDisableSharedMem -XX:+UseFastUnorderedTimeStamps -XX:+UseCriticalJavaThreadPriority -XX:ThreadPriorityPolicy=1 -XX:AllocatePrefetchStyle=3</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>🖥️ 系统需求</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>⚠️ 最低配置</strong> <strong>内存：</strong>6GB（已分配） <strong>显卡：</strong>RTX 2060 / GTX 1660 Ti <strong>CPU：</strong>Ryzen 5 5600X</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>✅ 推荐配置</strong> <strong>内存：</strong>10GB（或总内存的约65%）（已分配） <strong>显卡：</strong>RTX 4060 <strong>CPU：</strong>Ryzen 7 7800X3D</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>🧪 已在Macbook上测试</strong> M1 / M2 / M3 / Neo <strong>Windows</strong> AMD / Intel <strong>Linux</strong> AMD / Intel</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>特别感谢</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><strong>Odd_Turtle</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Nesil</strong>&nbsp;</li>\n<li><strong>soldierdonkey</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Ms Blind</strong></li>\n<li><strong>GunnerX（美术）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Grim（美术）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Ruseki（材质）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>oni7suKa（材质）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Starlezz（材质）</strong></li>\n<li><strong>lowpolycat（材质）</strong></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>我们有一个<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fapotheoticstudios.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方网站</a>！</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fapotheoticstudios.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_91b78000-80f8-4031-95e3-1f7542d33ed3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"583\" height=\"134\"></strong></a></p>",
